p.src:
The two axes of the primed frame now have parallel forms: $\begin{aligned}
x'=0 &\quad\Longleftrightarrow\quad x=vt,\\
t'=0 &\quad\Longleftrightarrow\quad t=vx.\end{aligned}$ They are reflections of one another about the right-moving light line $x=t$. The geometry has already replaced universal simultaneity.

